ion."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a classmate of the protagonist from their student days. Usually a dignified and serious teacher, she occasionally snaps at the protagonist as if transformed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having secretly harbored feelings for the protagonist during their student days, she now holds complex emotions regarding this inter-school competition."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c46546"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「聖メルハタ学園」側の総指揮を担当する女教師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段は凛とした佇まいの真面目な女性だが、主人公に対しては、たまに豹変したように「キレる」事がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生時代、主人公と同級生だったようで、密かに想いを寄せていたため、今回の対抗戦は複雑な心境を持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26787","sourceWorkId":"10441","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"聖メルハタ学園の教師。2年I組担任。今回の学園対抗戦のメル学側の総指揮を担当する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは、共に教員を目指していた学生時代の同級生である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あかぬけてイメージが変化したこともあり久しぶりに会った主人公は気付かず、薫子の方から声をかけることに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"当時、主人公に密かに思いを寄せていたこともあり、複雑な気持ちの中対抗戦を繰り広げていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公に対してはたまに豹変したようにキレることがある？が、普段は凛として真面目な教師。担当教科は国語（現国）。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"78670"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"105 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26787","sourceWorkId":"10441","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"167 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26787","sourceWorkId":"10441","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"91 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26787","sourceWorkId":"10441","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26787","sourceWorkId":"10441","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d86c6ced4e4e98c888f0138bf4e3d27cfcf9ace